%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a pattern used for a stroke. The stroke's colour is the
% pattern, so the content stream selects the pattern for the stroking
% operation as well as the non-stroking one, and the line is tiled
% with the cell.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
12 setlinewidth
100 100 moveto 400 400 lineto stroke
showpage
